{"name": "Monster Cuisine", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You like hunting monsters? Cooking them and selling them in your tavern? Crafting armour and weapons from their bones? Arm wrestling? Belly dancing?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Good. You are on the right page.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras_big/5b46d3bfdd9aea1beb1f7aaddbb90da3.webp?t=1788961180\" height=\"670\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/5b46d3bfdd9aea1beb1f7aaddbb90da3.avif?t=1788961180\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"186\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/9419947528b4f4616039e34cd6eef825.poster.avif?t=1788961180\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/9419947528b4f4616039e34cd6eef825.webm?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/9419947528b4f4616039e34cd6eef825.mp4?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Slaughter, season, sear, and serve delicious dishes for your customers and master a recipe book that grows as your kill count (and price) climbs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/4ffa67ed49156b722d34b77a2a7a9dad.poster.avif?t=1788961180\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/4ffa67ed49156b722d34b77a2a7a9dad.webm?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/4ffa67ed49156b722d34b77a2a7a9dad.mp4?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"186\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/1ce841abfacbeebc50e2a4b84120864a.poster.avif?t=1788961180\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/1ce841abfacbeebc50e2a4b84120864a.webm?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/1ce841abfacbeebc50e2a4b84120864a.mp4?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Satisfy a diverse cast of patrons with cozy, addictive mini-games where you keep the mugs full and plates hot as chaos ensues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/500a923cc688134633befa39dcd0663d.poster.avif?t=1788961180\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/500a923cc688134633befa39dcd0663d.webm?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/500a923cc688134633befa39dcd0663d.mp4?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"186\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/cbf839a17e06d9d2e47c659051a95cb3.poster.avif?t=1788961180\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/cbf839a17e06d9d2e47c659051a95cb3.webm?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/cbf839a17e06d9d2e47c659051a95cb3.mp4?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0Choose your weapon and your playstyle before going toe-to-toe with mythical creatures in glorious combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/c76262a31eec032ccf27b58e3c716d57.poster.avif?t=1788961180\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/c76262a31eec032ccf27b58e3c716d57.webm?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/c76262a31eec032ccf27b58e3c716d57.mp4?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"186\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/ef5fde96b49bb36a506cc07d8f3469ba.poster.avif?t=1788961180\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/ef5fde96b49bb36a506cc07d8f3469ba.webm?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/ef5fde96b49bb36a506cc07d8f3469ba.mp4?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experiment with your customizable armor sets as you forge the perfect build for your hunts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/3beae3f8efad2cdd1d99978cf5752465.poster.avif?t=1788961180\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/3beae3f8efad2cdd1d99978cf5752465.webm?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/3beae3f8efad2cdd1d99978cf5752465.mp4?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"186\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/608fa8a4a07a5fd19b9eed9cc211d511.poster.avif?t=1788961180\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/608fa8a4a07a5fd19b9eed9cc211d511.webm?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/608fa8a4a07a5fd19b9eed9cc211d511.mp4?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0Hunt and forage on expeditions across five unique biomes, defeating the most dangerous denizens of the Forbidden Forest and bringing them home for dinner</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/dbf506119c4d0227eea9326c2321df34.poster.avif?t=1788961180\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/dbf506119c4d0227eea9326c2321df34.webm?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/dbf506119c4d0227eea9326c2321df34.mp4?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/d2ee695d32237de6feeec78320c488ae.poster.avif?t=1788961180\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/d2ee695d32237de6feeec78320c488ae.webm?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/extras/d2ee695d32237de6feeec78320c488ae.mp4?t=1788961180\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Best a beast and serve a feast in Monster Cuisine, an action-RPG where you're a tavern keeper hunting fabled creatures in a forbidden forest to cook mythical meals and grow your business. Craft unique weapons and armor sets to take on stronger monsters that are as delicious as they are dangerous.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530800/caffb6ed3294d472eafb67206e098e1ea0bcbe36/header.jpg?t=1788961180", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "RPG", "Adventure", "Pixel Graphics", "Singleplayer", "Cooking"], "developers":